203	    /// Optional row background. When <see cref="BackgroundColor"/> has alpha > 0,
204	    /// the row's <see cref="SimpleButtonComponent.FillColor"/> is set and the hover /
205	    /// active states use the matching tint. The row's bounding box (and hit-test
206	    /// region) expand by <see cref="BackgroundPaddingX"/> / <see cref="BackgroundPaddingY"/>
