37	/// Yarn conversation. The line text wraps and reveals character-by-character; pick a reply
38	/// with the up/down arrows and E. Yarn <c>&lt;&lt;emote who kind&gt;&gt;</c> commands show
39	/// the speaker's framed portrait inside the box (left = NPC, right = player) and
40	/// <c>&lt;&lt;react who mark&gt;&gt;</c> pops a reaction mark above a character's head.
